force/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-17T09:39:12Z","updated_at":"2025-11-17T09:39:12Z","body":"If we wanted maximum contrast with the colors (which could be a sensible default), we should use golden angle increments (137.5° = 0.382) into the hue of `OkHsl` (with constant saturation and lightness).\r\nHowever, that might not play well with the theme (hard to say without testing). So practically, it could be interesting to use the above colors as orientation, and choose colors that play a bit better into the theme.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3540815600/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3541766709","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112314#issuecomment-3541766709","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112314","id":3541766709,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7TGxI1","user":{"login":"AdvanceControl","id":163237388,"node_id":"U_kgDOCbrODA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163237388?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdvanceControl","html_url":"https://github.com/AdvanceControl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdvanceControl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdvanceControl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdvanceControl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdvanceControl/starred{/owner}{/re